NOTE[en]("MUNICIPALITIES")="Data are territorially classified according to the Decree on the Standard Classification of Territorial Units <A class='seznam' HREF=https://www.stat.si/StatWeb/en/Methods/Classifications TARGET=_blank>description and explanations</A>, level SKTE 5. Data"
