" (by alphabet) and description on their territorial changes since 1995 the type of change is described together with the date when the described territorial change was taken into account in the territorial classification of units for statistical purposes"
" and the Official Journal in which the mentioned territorial changes were published. In the list of municipalities the last valid situation regarding the names of municipalities is stated.#";
